      "unidentified": "<h3>Statistics</h3><p><b>Damage</b> 1d6 (small), 1d8 (medium); <b>Critical</b> 20/x2; <b>Type</b> Slashing</p><h3>Description</h3>\n<h3>Combat Wok</h3>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 12 gil</p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d4 (small), 1d6 (medium)</p><p><strong>Critical:</strong> 19-20, x2</p><p><strong>Weight:</strong> 8 lbs.</p><p><strong>Damage Type:</strong> B</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> Fire (see text), chef</p><p><strong>Weapon Type:</strong> 1-handed Exotic</p><p>Weapons marked with the \"chef\" special quality can be used to cook as well as being a weapon. They confer a +2 bonus on Profession (Chef) skill checks for being equipped with the correct tools. Characters with 10 ranks in Profession (Chef) are automatically considered proficient in the use of these weapons.</p>"
